# An X session on Dolly's display: the Xsdl server, twm managing the
# windows, and three of X's own clients in theirs: a clock, eyes that follow
# the pointer and a terminal with a shell, where imgui-x11 starts Dear ImGui's
# example in a window of its own.
FROM /v0.1.4/Dollyfile-system bf94b7ea01fe1a46f412661c9528aee151913a0eca68a115b8adccbad11a3d3f
INSTALL /v0.1.4/demos/x11/Dollyfile-xorg-server 0a2daae547e368416b9fccfac56a0c9c7e0344922cdf152616932c1c0afb34ba
INSTALL /v0.1.4/demos/x11/Dollyfile-twm 2eea2bb00418b13097cbee1219b7b0f9721205cfc35f6d93b75aeff51cedee91
INSTALL /v0.1.4/demos/x11/Dollyfile-xclock 2a39997f192c533e3d2b3114dfb5f66d7fa4388a4a0f54af5193f9bf4f7a826f
INSTALL /v0.1.4/demos/x11/Dollyfile-xeyes 6f4be78d33cea0858bfe6ad6858b71a1394461f0cdc9bfb03a0642461d405c9e
